Identifying training needs of the team and individuals;
Mentoring and coaching engineers;
Recruitment (on/off boarding), hiring, and training of new talent;
Ensure individuals and team align with company policies, training, compliance modules etc.
What you bring to the team
University degree in IT or engineering;
10+ years of IT experience, including leadership roles;
Strong engineering foundation with hands-on experience in Java, Spring Boot, Python, REST APIs design and implementation, knowledge about SOAP;
Experience with front-end technologies (JavaScript, HTML, CSS, TypeScript) will be appreciated;
Skilled in modern architecture, DevOps, CI/CD (Azure DevOps), and containerization (Kubernetes, Docker, OpenShift);
Experience with SRE tooling (Grafana, Prometheus), integration (Kafka, JMS, MQ), testing frameworks (JUnit, Selenium, Cucumber), and databases (Oracle, Hibernate, ElasticSearch);
Previous coordination role with the ability to build teams from scratch;
Proven experience and expertise in delivering high quality enterprise applications;
Excellent Stakeholder Management;
Strong interpersonal and written and verbal communication skills;
In depth knowledge of industry standard best practices, development lifecycle processes and methodologies. Experience using agile methodology is a plus;
Thorough understanding of quality management;
If you want to deep dive into the processing of personal data conducted by ING Hubs Romania during the recruitment process and your rights related to it, read theprivacy noticeson ourwebsite(make sure to scroll until you reach the Data Protection section/ Candidates tab).
